{"id":"wb-8-406","name":"陈白沙祠","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"陈白沙祠","text":"陈白沙祠，又称白沙祠，位于中国广东省江门市蓬江区白沙大道（原属新会县白沙乡白沙村），为纪念明代思想家陈白沙（陈献章）而诏建的的明代合院式祠堂建筑，现已辟为陈白沙纪念馆。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%99%88%E7%99%BD%E6%B2%99%E7%A5%A0","revisionId":92704035,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92704035","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/cc1b121312a364eaf466f926.jpg","title":"江门市白沙祠内.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%B1%9F%E9%97%A8%E5%B8%82%E7%99%BD%E6%B2%99%E7%A5%A0%E5%86%85.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/%E6%B1%9F%E9%97%A8%E5%B8%82%E7%99%BD%E6%B2%99%E7%A5%A0%E5%86%85.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Limingqimonkey","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​白沙祠是明代白沙人陈白沙的家祠","width":320,"height":427}}